What Happens Internally?

Suppose Chrome wants to read a file.

Step 1

Chrome executes:

read()
Step 2

CPU switches from User Mode to Kernel Mode.

(More on this in the next topic.)

Step 3

Kernel executes requested operation.

Step 4

Result returned.

Step 5

CPU returns to User Mode.

